{"id":"vod_bf_2916","vodId":"2916","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"变形金刚：银河之力","name_cn":"变形金刚：银河之力","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-4/8b03c8caee7f2e6277ea7853aba3099e.jpg"},"summary":"宇宙中一个超级黑洞，正在向塞博特恩袭来。但是，没有任何对抗这个黑洞的手段，塞博特恩只有被消灭的命运。就在这个时候，一个叫引天行的古代战士穿越时空，来到了塞博特恩。引天行声称只有一种叫“Planet Force 行星之力”的东西可以拯救塞博特恩。“行星之力”是由创造宇宙的元始天尊的火种制造，它们有着具有巨大的威力。运用这种力量，就可以摧毁黑洞，恢复所有被吞噬的星球。为了争夺这些上古圣物，两派争端再起。随着4个藏有行星之力的星球逐步被发现，原来越多风格各异的变形金刚卷了进来。烈焰擎天柱、火线擎天柱、守护擎天柱、巨神擎天柱，他们是敌是友，他们能否帮助星辰擎天柱最终摧毁黑洞，战胜神尊威震天。这一切都将在华丽的CG动画中完美展现。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 16:55:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/bianxingjingangyinhezhili/第12集/ind